        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Two green lights open in the bark, and this time they open quickly.* Hoom, hom -- the one who woke me. I am still awake, root-friend, and I will be for an age yet. Go carefully in my wood."
          }
        }
      },
