        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The green lights half-close.* Begin when I stir, and not before. Watch my bark, singer -- I will tell you when. Hoom... and know your matter as well as your music. I will be listening to both."
          }
        }
      }
